      "correspondence": "realize each divisor by a fractional ideal. For the transfer from j to i use C=I(d) and D=I(a_i+d−a_j). Choose u∈C and v∈D with uC⁻¹+vD⁻¹=R; choose s∈C⁻¹,r∈D⁻¹ so us−vr=1. Its inverse enforces both inclusions. Scale by β on one coordinate, then use equal-total moves. The displayed necessary condition is the direct determinant-ideal interpretation and is distinguished from the formal sufficient implication.",
